# What the deploy must not serve. Same syntax as .gitignore, so a pattern with
# no slash matches at any depth - *.md catches every game's DESIGN.md as well as
# the seat files at the root.
#
# Until this list grew past the repo's own plumbing, every doc, test and design
# mockup was live at its own URL. What a visitor needs is the pages, the
# stylesheets, hub.js, wordmark.js and assets/; everything named below is machinery.

.git
.gitignore
.claude
.wrangler
node_modules
package.json
package-lock.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore

# assets/fonts/OFL.txt is deliberately not here: the SIL Open Font License is
# meant to travel with the fonts it covers.
*.md
tests
design
